Smart Traffic Light Simulator – Python

It will work like:

🔴 Red → 🟡 Yellow → 🟢 Green → repeat

import time

print("🚦 Smart Traffic Light Simulator")
print("--------------------------------")

while True:
    print("🔴 RED - Stop")
    time.sleep(5)

    print("🟡 YELLOW - Get Ready")
    time.sleep(2)

    print("🟢 GREEN - Go")
    time.sleep(5)

    print("\nCycle completed!\n

💡 How it works
🔴 Red → 5 seconds → Stop
🟡 Yellow → 2 seconds → Get Ready
🟢 Green → 5 seconds → Go
Then it starts again automatically.
